⚙️ GLOBAL RULES (APPLY TO EVERY TILE)

These rules are mandatory and override everything else:

All tiles must be 64x64 pixels.
Top-down perspective.
Pixel-art style, chunky and readable (Metal Slug–inspired).
No directional lighting.
No gradients that cross tile edges.
