Background must be transparent (alpha) or cleanly tileable.

🎨 STYLE DEFINITION
Material: soft clouds, but slightly structured
Shapes: rounded, puffy, medium density
Contrast: low–medium (gameplay readability first)
Avoid:
Noise
Hyper-detail
Blurry gradients
Think: solid clouds you can walk on
